## Proposed Changes

### Backend Components (`api`)

#### [MODIFY] [service.go](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Desktop/Everything/AI_DAY/api/internal/generation/service.go)
- Add `Retry(ctx context.Context, jobID, userID string) error` method:
  - Verifies the job exists and belongs to the specified `userID`.
  - Ensures the current `status` is `'failed'`.
  - Updates the job status to `'queued'`, clears `error_code` and `error_message`, and updates `updated_at`.
  - Retains existing `input` and `output` state intact.

#### [MODIFY] [generation_handlers.go](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Desktop/Everything/AI_DAY/api/internal/httpapi/generation_handlers.go)
- Add `retryGenerationHandler(a *auth.Service, g *generation.Service) http.HandlerFunc`:
  - Handles `POST /api/v1/generations/{id}/retry`.
  - Extracts authenticated user and URL parameter `{id}`.
  - Calls `g.Retry(ctx, id, user.ID)`.
  - Returns `http.StatusOK` with `{"jobId": id, "status": "queued"}`.

#### [MODIFY] [routes.go](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Desktop/Everything/AI_DAY/api/internal/httpapi/routes.go)
- Register route `r.Post("/generations/{id}/retry", retryGenerationHandler(a, g))` inside authenticated router group.

